{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24818","headline":"题马侍中燧木香亭 · 邵楚苌","name":"题马侍中燧木香亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春日迟迟木香阁，窈窕佳人褰绣幕。\n淋漓玉露滴紫蕤，绵蛮黄鸟窥朱萼。\n横汉碧云歌处断，满地花钿舞时落。\n树影参差斜入檐，风动玲珑水晶箔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵楚苌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}